[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0600","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0600.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0177","title":"DNSTools DNSTools CGI 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"DNSTools 1.0.8及1.10版本的CGI应用程序存在输入验证漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在HTTP请求中向CGI脚本传递包含shell元字符的特制参数，绕过输入过滤机制，进而以Web服务器权限在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响DNSTools 1.0.8及1.10版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0177"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:09Z","remediation":"修复 DNSTools CGI 脚本中 system() 调用前的输入验证缺陷：对 host_name 和 domain_name 等用户参数使用 Perl 的 quotemeta 函数或手动转义过滤分号(;)、管道符(|)、反引号(`)、美元符号($)等 shell 元字符。如厂商已停止维护无补丁版本，应立即移除 DNSTools CGI 目录或禁用 Web 服务器的 CGI 执行权限；临时缓解措施可在 Web 服务器层配置 mod_rewrite 规则拦截含 shell 元字符的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0000.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1028","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19786","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0177.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0177","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0177/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0177.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0177.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hj4h-cmw3-42v5/GHSA-hj4h-cmw3-42v5.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1028/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/be49e1130e6bdca092999eb707c2ff3d8d256a74/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-01xx/CVE-2000-0177.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8a6655af-4b15-46f4-92b7-3869ff8983b2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0600.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0600.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0600.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0170","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0170.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0193","title":"Corel Linux OS Dosemu 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Corel Linux OS 1.0 的 Dosemu 模拟器默认配置存在权限配置不当漏洞，本地攻击者可利用 Dosemu 默认集成的 system.com 程序执行任意系统命令，从而获取提升后的系统权限。该漏洞影响 Corel Linux OS 1.0 版本，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限即可利用，无需认证，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0193"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:11Z","remediation":"升级 dosemu 至 1.2.0 以上版本，或修改 dosemu.conf 配置文件，将 `$_system.com` 设置为禁用，同时限制本地用户对 dosemu 二进制文件的执行权限，仅允许受信任用户组使用。鉴于 Corel Linux 已停止维护，建议迁移至持续更新的 Debian 系发行版。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1030","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200003020436.PAA20168%40jawa.chilli.net.au","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19787","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0193.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0193","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0193.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0193.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jw72-8cwx-jh57/GHSA-jw72-8cwx-jh57.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0193.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0170.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0167","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0167.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0190","title":"AOL Instant Messenger 3.5 消息中畸形ASCII值拒绝服务漏洞","description":"AOL Instant Messenger（AIM）3.5 版本客户端存在输入验证漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的畸形 ASCII 值消息，导致 AIM 客户端崩溃或停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞源于客户端对消息中异常 ASCII 值的处理逻辑缺陷，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，影响所有运行 AIM 3.5 的系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0190"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:11Z","remediation":"升级 AOL Instant Messenger 至 4.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复畸形 ASCII 消息导致的客户端崩溃问题。由于 AIM 服务已于 2017 年 12 月全面关闭，建议彻底停用该产品并迁移至其他即时通讯方案。如短期无法升级，可在网关或防火墙上禁用 AIM 协议的 OSCAR 端口（TCP 5190）作为临时缓解措施，阻止外部恶意消息触达客户端。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0016.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0190.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604