受支持的 IRIX 版本已终止生命周期，需升级至新一代操作系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1031","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19788","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0207.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0207","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0207.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0207.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/infosrch.nasl","https://github.com/elastic/integrations/blob/595ae94eea7a80f1083cfcb245ece72d30621ad6/packages/symantec_endpoint/_dev/deploy/docker/sample_logs/symantec_endpoint.log","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-f227-g5q7-7x4w/GHSA-f227-g5q7-7x4w.json","https://github.com/decal/werdlists/blob/81edb463f7f6311c85defefaf75ac9cd58e5cfb9/exploit-info/symantec-attack-signatures.txt","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0668.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0178","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0178.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0201","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer showHelp 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Internet Explorer 5.x 中的 window.showHelp() 方法未限制 HTML 帮助文件（.chm）仅从本地主机执行，远程攻击者可通过 Microsoft 网络共享诱导用户打开特制的 .chm 文件，从而在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 5.x 系列版本，攻击者需结合社会工程学手段诱使用户访问恶意页面或打开恶意帮助文件才能触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0201"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:12Z","remediation":"升级至 Internet Explorer 5.5 或更高版本以修复此漏洞，该漏洞的补丁包含在微软 MS00-021 安全公告中。如无法升级 IE，可通过组策略禁用 HTML Help 执行权限或阻止来自不受信来源的 .chm 文件下载。鉴于 IE 已停止支持，建议迁移至 Microsoft Edge。如仍须使用旧版 IE，务必在受限环境中运行并启用最高安全级别。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1033","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0201.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0201","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0201.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0201.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-489p-9hgq-jg94/GHSA-489p-9hgq-jg94.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0201.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2c2e5f6f-3a39-42df-928a-348b2f4bc4b3.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/80642f827c3cd89c2fb8893d0e3fe04ead516ea4/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0178.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0178.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0166","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0166.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0189","title":"Allaire ColdFusion Server 路径信息泄露漏洞","description":"Allaire ColdFusion Server 4.x 版本中存在服务器信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求访问 application.cfm 或 onrequestend.cfm 文件，即可获取服务器的真实物理路径信息。该漏洞利用方式简单且易于探测，泄露的路径信息可被用于后续更深入攻击的信息收集阶段，增加系统被进一步入侵的风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0189"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:11Z","remediation":"升级到 Adobe ColdFusion 2018 或 2021 及以上版本（该漏洞仅影响 ColdFusion 4.x 及更早版本）。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器（IIS/Apache）层面配置规则阻止对 application.cfm 和 onrequestend.cfm 的直接访问；同时将 ColdFusion 管理台的错误处理设置为自定义错误页，关闭详细错误信息显示，防止路径泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1021","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0189.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0189","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0189.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0189.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4rjq-mf8f-5v58/GHSA-4rjq-mf8f-5v58.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0189.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leeg