级，在 Serv-U 配置中将默认错误提示信息修改为固定通用提示（如 \"File not found\"），避免返回真实路径；同时在 FTP 根目录限制用户访问权限，避免 web 目录与系统目录交叉。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-02/0417.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1016","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0176.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0176","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0176.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0176.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8585-x3v3-r54f/GHSA-8585-x3v3-r54f.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ftp_servu_path_disclosure.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0176.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--957ae3ce-6f58-4592-a5fb-3d6d37e65665.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0155.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0179","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0179.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0203","title":"Trend Micro OfficeScan 3.5 tmlisten.exe 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Trend Micro OfficeScan 3.5 的 tmlisten.exe 组件存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向 12345 端口发送特制的畸形数据包，触发该组件异常崩溃，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 OfficeScan 3.5 版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0203"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-28T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:12Z","remediation":"立即安装 Trend Micro 官方提供的 OfficeScan 3.5 补丁（下载地址 http://www.antivirus.com/download/ofce_patch_35.htm）。建议升级到不再使用 tmlisten.exe 的受支持版本（如 Apex One）。若无法立即升级，在防火墙上阻断外部对 TCP 端口 12345 的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.antivirus.com/download/ofce_patch_35.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1013","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=412FC0AFD62ED31191B40008C7E9A11A0D481D%40srvnt04.previnet.it","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=D129BBE1730AD2118A0300805FC1C2FE038AF28B%40209-76-212-10.trendmicro.com","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0203.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0203","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0203.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0203.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8pmq-57jj-jpjv/GHSA-8pmq-57jj-jpjv.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/T/tmosdos.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0203.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb6