,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0178"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-28T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:09Z","remediation":"建议升级 ServerIron 交换机固件至启用了 RFC 1948 随机初始序列号(ISN)生成算法的最新版本。由于 Foundry Networks 已被 Brocade 收购（后并入 Broadcom），请登录 Broadcom/Brocade 支持门户检查对应型号是否有安全固件更新。如设备已停止维护无法升级，可在边界防火墙上启用 TCP 序列号随机化功能（如 Cisco ASA 的 tcp-randomize-sequence-number），或部署 IPS 设备对 TCP 会话进行完整性校验，并严格限制网络设备管理接口仅允许可信管理网段访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.foundrynet.com/bugTraq.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1017","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0178.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0178","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0178.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0178.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xwch-qpr5-vp62/GHSA-xwch-qpr5-vp62.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0178.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--850699b2-b4a4-44b3-855a-67222684f5a8.owl","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_